From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xilinx <xilinx@amd.com>
Date: Tue, 27 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] microblaze: Refresh all patches for newlib 4.6.0

Consolidate patches 0001-0011 into a single zero-fuzz patch for newlib 4.6.0.

0001:
 Nagaraju Mekala<nmekala@xilix.com>

 Modified the _exceptional_handler to support the changes made in GCC related to Superviosry call

0002:
 David Holsgrove <david.holsgrove@xilinx.com>

 Add missing declarations for xil_printf to stdio.h for inclusion in toolchain and use in c++ apps

0003/0004:
 deleting the xil_printf.c file as now it part of BSP
 deleting the xil_printf.o from MAKEFILE

0005:
 Nagaraju Mekala <nmekala@xilix.com>

 MB-X intial commit

0006:
 Mahesh Bodapati <mbodapat@xilinx.com>

 newlib port for microblaze m64 flag...

0007:
 Nagaraju Mekala <nmekala@xilix.com>

 fixing the bug in crt files, added addlik instead of lli insn

0008:
 Mahesh Bodapati <mbodapat@xilinx.com>

 Added MB-64 support to strcmp/strcpy/strlen files

0009:
 Mahesh Bodapati <mbodapat@xilinx.com>

 Removing the Assembly implementation of 64bit string function.

0010:
 Nagaraju <nmekala@xilinx.com>

 Fixed the bug in crtinit.s for MB-64

0011:
 Aayush Misra <aayushm@amd.com>

 Use port-specific sbrk

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Xilinx local patches]

AI-Generated: Github Copilot (Claude Opus 4.8)

Signed-off-by: Mark Hatle <mark.hatle@amd.com>

